# Adapter Contract

- All adapters implement `RobotAdapter` (descriptor, capabilities, snapshot, submit, cancel, events).
- Adapter responsibilities: auth, DTO mapping, error mapping, webhook/poll, rate limit, model/firmware compatibility.
- Adapter must NOT own tenant authz, business state machine, global scheduling, billing, or SLA.
- First real vendor adapters come after Simulator vertical loop and Adapter TCK.
- Support levels: Simulator / Beta / Supported / Blocked.
